intensity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/bc6ae6cca411d92b0dd073529188c293.poster.avif?t=1769684755\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/bc6ae6cca411d92b0dd073529188c293.webm?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/bc6ae6cca411d92b0dd073529188c293.mp4?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not alone. Companions with diverse abilities will fight by your side—just find the right potions to unleash their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/740200c33d23558475dc7eec05497984.poster.avif?t=1769684755\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/740200c33d23558475dc7eec05497984.webm?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/740200c33d23558475dc7eec05497984.mp4?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>200 skill, gem, and companion cards</strong>, no two runs will ever be the same.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knight Island</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where you build a powerful <i>Skill Deck</i> to conquer the mysterious island you’ve been cast onto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea