10/extras/bc6ae6cca411d92b0dd073529188c293.mp4?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not alone. Companions with diverse abilities will fight by your side—just find the right potions to unleash their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/740200c33d23558475dc7eec05497984.poster.avif?t=1769684755\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/740200c33d23558475dc7eec05497984.webm?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/extras/740200c33d23558475dc7eec05497984.mp4?t=1769684755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over <strong>200 skill, gem, and companion cards</strong>, no two runs will ever be the same.</p>", "short_description": "Tile-based strategy with the best aspects of roguelike deck builders. On top of that, unique mechanics that allow you to shape your island as you wish. Knight Island is a game that blends these features you'll love in this genre and immerses you in unique battles.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/c741b3e243ea51751767ac55f82d5a73f9f5cd54/header.jpg?t=1769684755", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2785710/1132d21b7d183c1a5b1d136ddfc3a96935d4a8ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769684755", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st